n the Hedge<br /> <br /> An Eshmaki Collector who does the ludicrously dangerous job of stealing Changelings from Arcadia. His hoard is the support network of Changeling Kin he puts together from the survivors. He will definitely need from the shadows. He teaches the lesson that people are not toys.<br /> <br /> And his darker counterpart, an Ugallu Nemesis based off the dark truth that True Fae are kin too. Basically, he's a privateer who punishes Changelings for breaking the pacts they made with the True Fae by escaping. He teaches other people the lessons of &quot;stick to your word&quot; and &quot;don't mess with the fae world in the first place&quot;<br /> <br /> Have I mentioned I love making evil Nemesis Beasts?</div> </div> </div> </div>The latter is now more definitely a Talassii, and the new Family works far better than Ugallu ever did","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T09:23:04-07:00","id":1200460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=