at","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 05-10-2018, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-10T21:59:59-07:00","id":1217588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217558#post1217558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm away from books at the moment. Am I correct in remembering that Hunger only mechanically affects how you can feed?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean like you can't have a collector feed by burning down a hospital just to make large groups of people despair and such if they aren't actually collecting something from the whole enterprise?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-10T22:12:00-07:00","id":1217590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217588#post1217588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You mean like you can't have a collector feed by burning down a hospital just to make large groups of people despair and such if they aren't actually collecting something from the whole enterprise?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not really what I'm talking about. I'm asking about what mechanics the y-splat of Hungers interacts with, whether there are any mechanics other than feeding that would be affected by it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T04:29:21-07:00","id":1217622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217590#post1217590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's not really what I'm talking about. I'm asking about what mechanics the y-splat of Hungers interacts with, whether there are any mechanics other than feeding that would be affected by it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think currently, there is nothing mechanically affected by Hunger other than Feeding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T06:29:37-07:00","id":1217647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217622#post1217622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think currently, there is nothing mechanically affected by Hunger other than Feeding.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Some atavisms (needs must and heart of the ocean, don't know if there are any others) use it. You track what you can feed on, but you don't necessary have to feed when you find your mark.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24132,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24132-iceben","user":"IceBen","date":". 05-11-2018, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24132-iceben","name":"IceBen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T07:07:02-07:00","id":1217651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IceBen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217647#post1217647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Some atavisms (needs must and heart of the ocean, don't know if there are any others) use it. You track what you can feed on, but you don't necessary have to feed when you find your mark.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, but those don't specifically do something different for you if you're a Ravager or a Predator, right?<br /> The way I understood <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8331_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8331\" data-vbnamecard=\"8331\">milo v3</a>, he is looking for something like Hunger-exclusive Merits (e.g. like how some Merits are Invictus Only, e.g. Invested I think it was called).<br /> A Ravager does not get a 'Hunger-Birthright&quot; or anything like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T07:09:53-07:00","id":1217652,"title":"","content":"Ah, yeah, in that case no, things interact with Hunger at most, but nothing is defined by them afaik.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24132-iceben","name":"IceBen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T07:31:47-07:00","id":1217659,"title":"","content":"Those atavisms are relevant as well (as would be any hunger exclusive Merits). Thank you for mentioning them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T19:37:23-07:00","id":1217867,"title":"","content":"What would nightmares that beasts would get allied with the SOTT be? Something like restence is futile?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T22:13:26-07:00","id":1217889,"title":"","content":"So I'm reading about horrorspawn and I'm confused. they can become your horror if you really keep to it, but the beast will never be the same? Or is the players guide meaning that while it has not become your horror the beast won't be the same","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T22:39:13-07:00","id":1217891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217889#post1217889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm reading about horrorspawn and I'm confused. they can become your horror if you really keep to it, but the beast will never be the same? Or is the players guide meaning that while it has not become your horror the beast won't be the same</div> </div> </div> </div>If your Horror is killed, normally you die. If you have Horrorspawn, there is a chance that they will replace the Horror and give you a window of time in which you may feed it enough that you continue to live in a diminished state \u2014 while you're girding the Horrorspawn to act as a replacement Horror you cannot spend Willpower or Experiences, and even if you manage to succeed, you can still never recover Willpower from rest again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T22:41:21-07:00","id":1217892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217889#post1217889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm reading about horrorspawn and I'm confused. they can become your horror if you really keep to it, but the beast will never be the same? Or is the players guide meaning that while it has not become your horror the beast won't be the same</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In the event that your Horror is destroyed, the Horrorspawn is potentially capable of becoming a replacement to the original Horror. The reason it is said that the Horrorspawn never become a true replacement is because the spawn is only ever a fragment of the whole. It doesn't think the same, it doesn't have the innate complexities. Basically it functions well enough, that the Beast can still have their powers and the connection to the Primordial Dream, and most importantly not be dead. The Horrorspawn however doesn't have the mental faculties, the restraint, or the instincts to be a replacement for the whole. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-12T06:05:10-07:00","id":1217943,"title":"","content":"Oh. Is it even worth doing for your character then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-12T06:10:11-07:00","id":1217946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1217943#post1217943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh. Is it even worth doing for your character then?</div> </div> </div> </div>Some would consider it better than dying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/av