sage\">Really I could have just said &quot;Strix make everything worse, without question.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>True, they're reliable that way, those damn owls","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T16:57:49-07:00","id":1235109,"title":"","content":"Speaking of that what happpens if a Spirt possesses a Beast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T23:12:43-07:00","id":1235193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235109#post1235109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of that what happpens if a Spirt possesses a Beast</div> </div> </div> </div>Like said earlier, we don\u2019t really have the rules for Beasts getting possessed by ephemeral or pseudo-ephemeral entities yet, other than assuming that it\u2019s at least possible since nowhere in the currently published rules say otherwise. <br /> <br /> And without RAW, my current headcanon is that while spirits and such can Urge and Possess freely, once they start Claiming a Beast they\u2019re dropped into the Lair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T23:19:05-07:00","id":1235195,"title":"","content":"I feel like the casual answer to any &quot;What if Beasts are possessed by X?&quot; is almost always gonna be A) Same as when anything else gets possessed barring exceptional rules, and B) Really Bad Shit Happens.<br /> <br /> I mean, these concepts are probably universally true across the board, ranging from the Ghost/Spirit/Goetia/Angel configurations to the more esoteric and terrifying Strix/idigam/abyssal entitiy/supernal entity/qashmallim/effects of a title/weird shit of Hunter/what the fuck is happening in the Underworld/dear god why is Mummy Cosmology a thing/Insatiable and More Asides categories.<br /> <br /> Anything beyond that demands the specifics of a story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T07:14:26-07:00","id":1235262,"title":"","content":"Okay! So the Horor whould try to eat it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:09:23-07:00","id":1235282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235262#post1235262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay! So the Horor whould try to eat it?</div> </div> </div> </div>If it tried to come in through a lair entrance, one assumes so, yes.<br /> <br /> But if it possesses you from outside, like most things do?<br /> <br /> I would assume it doesn't have the chance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:11:29-07:00","id":1235283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235282#post1235282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it tried to come in through a lair entrance, one assumes so, yes.<br /> <br /> But if it possesses you from outside, like most things do?<br /> <br /> I would assume it doesn't have the chance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the Lair and Horror occupy the place where a soul usually is, yes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:13:57-07:00","id":1235284,"title":"","content":"Unless possessions specifically involves hijacking the soul, it should be just like any other possession","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:24:41-07:00","id":1235287,"title":"","content":"Can I use vengeful earth satiety (expenditure), to apply Basilisk's Touch from afar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","user":"Wormwood","date":". 07-15-2018, 01:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:40:06-07:00","id":1235290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235283#post1235283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the Lair and Horror occupy the place where a soul usually is, yes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct, but the metaphysics of how possession works when one has a pocket dimension holding a small-world-soul-avatar-dipped-in-human-mythology-and-battered-in-human-flesh is a surprisingly not well discussed issue in Beast. We have no text on the subject of what happens when a Possessing entity tries to posses them. Given that, I prefer to keep things simple until notified otherwise.<br /> <br /> I mean, otherwise, yes, we know most attempts to manipulate a soul with Beasts involves needing to go into the Lair, so if you wanna push the angle, it's there,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T10:57:42-07:00","id":1235296,"title":"","content":"All this talking about Strix made me come up with an antagonist duo made of an Insatiable and an Owl of Dis. The fun part is that the Strix is the one more likely to betray the other. Here's another for my list of things to do<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235287#post1235287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can I use vengeful earth satiety (expenditure), to apply Basilisk's Touch from afar?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd allow it depending on the nature of that Vengeful Earth. If it makes sense for the looks and themes of that Horror's Vengeful Earth, I'd be open to the option.<br /> <br /> Limbs made of rocks? Eh, not really. Thorned vines, Zyra-style, swarms of insects taking the shape of hands or radioactive sludge, just to make a couple of examples? Yeah, go for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T11:15:09-07:00","id":1235299,"title":"","content":"I've got an idigam, an Insatiable, and a changeling who want to grab a Rank 5 Cosmic Seba in an effort to completely unmake Fate, as antagonist sets go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T14:32:30-07:00","id":1235341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235299#post1235299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got an idigam, an Insatiable, and a changeling who want to grab a Rank 5 Cosmic Seba in an effort to completely unmake Fate, as antagonist sets go.</div> </div> </div> </div>Separately, or as a Legion of Doom?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T14:34:02-07:00","id":1235343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235341#post1235341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Separately, or as a Legion of Doom?</div> </div> </div> </div>Allegiance of Fuck-This-Star-Crossed-Shit featuring Friend-Who-Just-Giggles-At-Thought-of-Eating-Stars.<br /> <br /> Specifically you have an idigam who has Trouble Taking No For An Answer from Sagrim-Ur and has come to blame cosmic fate for their positions and as such has become a spirit of cosmic misfortune in an attempt to manipulate it and oh also has claimed a Forsaken rube who has unrequited pinings for one of Red Wolf's avatars, a Wyrd-locked Red Rose Courtier who's not only tired of the shit but reckons that a dissolution of the Wyrd would end the reign of the Strangers, and a Void Ravager who has no real personal stakes in it but is fascinated by how everyone else seems tied to the tide of fate and wonders if you even <i>could</i> unravel Fate with humanity being a thing. Also eating that whole strata of cosmology sounds <i>appetizing</i>.<br /> <br /> The game this group'll feature in also includes a Nosferatu Ordo Dracul, a young Tremere, and a Promethean as a group who want to use the Seba to see if they can make a soul for Paris and then Diablerize it, a demon who wants to swap it out using Infrastructure for the Heart of Re, a Sin-Eater under a krewe possibly led by the geists of Joan of Arc and Gilles De Rais whose geist <i>will not shut up about the seba</i>, and Kehetkhat.<br /> <br /> I do not design clusterfucks, nope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-15-2018, 08:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T16:43:39-07:00","id":1235361,"title":"","content":"Do they Fuck?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T17:01:38-07:00","id":1235366,"title":"","content":"Are you asking about Beasts in general or the Legion of Doom?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T17:02:44-07:00","id":1235368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235361#post1235361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do they Fuck?</div> </div> </div> </div>Who are they?<br /> <br /> Assuming it's any of those antagonists that I just listed, um, no? I hadn't planned on it? I mean, they could, no reason not to, but it was not exactly a question I answered. I'm more busy wondering if any of them outside of Kehetkhat and the Sin-Eater could actually achieve their goal* and/or if I will ever get to run this crossover game with the group I want to.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, if my antagonist set, then why the hell is the first thing you want to know about my antagonist set their sexual activity? That's a weird question to ask.<br /> <br /> *if it <i>weren't</i> the scenario where in I make a Fatewalker (Apotheosized Deceived, folks who don't know Arc-parlance).<br /> <br /> EDIT: It occurs to me, too late, that this line of questioning may in fact just be a joke about my use of clusterfuck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-15-2018, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T19:52:18-07:00","id":1235401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1235368#post1235368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who are they?<br /> <br /> Assuming it's any of those antagonists that I just listed, um, no? I hadn't planned on it? I mean, they could, no reason not to, but it was not exactly a question I answered. I'm more busy wondering if any of them outside of Kehetkhat and the Sin-Eater could actually achieve their goal* and/or if I will ever get to run this crossover game with the group I want to.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, if my antagonist set, then why the hell is the first thing you want to know about my antagonist set their sexual activity? That's a weird question to ask.<br /> <br /> *if it <i>weren't</i> the scenario where in I make a Fatewalker (Apotheosized Deceived, folks who don't know Arc-parlance).<br /> <br /> EDIT: It occurs to me, too late, that this line of questioning may in fact just be a joke about my use of clusterfuck.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m talking about the antagonists. it wast mostly a joke","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T12:46:52-07:00","id":1235688,"title":"","content":"How would a Beast deal with solving abilities like Domination, whose Conditions are resolved by going through a breaking point?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15464-raphatheascended","name":"RaphaTheAscended","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T13:22:20-07:00","id":1235697,"title":"","content":"Dropping or raising to extremes in Satiety is often used to get rid of particularly bothersome Conditions like Anathema. I'd apply the same here, I guess.<br /> <br /> Question: Would you let the Strength-Bonus of e.g. Skin Deep's or Cyclopean Strength's Satiety Expenditure apply to Vengeful Earth's Satiety Expenditure?<br /> Because if so, a Lair 3 Beast could launch ranged attacks with +10 dice to the attack pool, which would be both epic and scary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","user":"Wormwood","date":". 07-17-2018, 04:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T11:07:34-07:00","id":1236022,"title":"","content":"Does Passing Resemblance work to fool other Beasts using Family Resemblance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11321-sinister-spider","name":"Sinister Spider","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T13:39:29-07:00","id":1236120,"title":"","content":"Q: Is the Beast's Horror capable of devouring souls through nightmares? <br /> There is a lengthy discussion in the core book about the Devouring and the Horror consuming a wannabe Beast' soul, but I couldn't find any specific rule or description of the Horror devouring regular human souls. Can a horror devour a soul at whim? Can a Beast direct his/her Horror to do it at will?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T13:49:01-07:00","id":1236123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zooroos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1236120#post1236120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Q: Is the Beast's Horror capable of devouring souls through nightmares?<br /> There is a lengthy discussion in the core book about the Devouring and the Horror consuming a wannabe Beast' soul, but I couldn't find any specific rule or description of the Horror devouring regular human souls. Can a horror devour a soul at whim? Can a Beast direct his/her Horror to do it at will?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. There is a Nightmare that suppresses a soul, causing the victim to suffer the effects of soul loss, which could be reskinned, though. And that power could be built as an Atavism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T15:47:07-07:00","id":1236180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1236123#post1236123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No. There is a Nightmare that suppresses a soul, causing the victim to suffer the effects of soul loss, which could be reskinned, though. And that power could be built as an Atavism.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That's what I thought, too. But then, how does a Beast or a Horror devours a fledgeling Beast' soul?<br /> <br /> See, one of my players wants to introduce a friend of his to the game, by making his Beast PC find a soon-to-be Beast and proceed with the Devouring himself. Is this something the elder Beast instinctively knows how to do, like giving birth, or is it something more dependent on the particular circumstances or the other' soul?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":216,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","user":"Zooroos","date":". 07-17-2018, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T17:47:29-07:00","id":1236221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zooroos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1236180#post1236180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! That's what I thought, too. But then, how does a Beast or a Horror devours a fledgeling Beast' soul?<br /> <br /> See, one of my players wants to introduce a friend of his to the game, by making his Beast PC find a soon-to-be Beast and proceed with the Devouring himself. Is this something the elder Beast instinctively knows how to do, like giving birth, or is it something more dependent on the particular circumstances or the other' soul?</div> </div> </div> </div>The nearest mechanical analogue is likely the process that plays out in an exceptional success on an Inflicting Nightmares roll with the wrinkle that the subject is a deep-dreamer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thanked