 your shared Lair, made your way to the Chamber and the NPCs started waking up sometime after everyone arrived.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, I've made a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1368930-beastly-visages-and-gruesome-maps\">thread</a> where B:TP players can describe the Horrors and Lairs of their Begotten Characters. You can do it via any medium (be it video, writing, image, etc.), and in any layout (Poem, Epic, Document, Parable, etc) and/or fashion (Medievle Theatre, Po's Horror Movie, 21st Century Documentary, etc), you desire, so I suggest getting the rest of your Troupe (alongside yourself, naturally) to head over there and share such details... if you desire to, that is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-24T21:49:18-07:00","id":1398706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition?p=1398687#post1398687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__doubl